id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45189::$$$message_0409_0000_0000$$$::"Here you go, Kayneth."::
45190::$$$message_0409_0000_0001$$$::"Th-thank you, Sola-Ui."::
45191::$$$message_0409_0000_0002$$$::"Fine wine in an open-air hot spring... I suppose this small island nation has its perks."::
45192::$$$message_0409_0000_0003$$$::"Lancer. Come here and soothe your wounds. Don't make Sola-Ui do all the pouring herself."::
45193::$$$message_0409_0000_0004$$$::"I couldn't possibly, lord. I am happy simply to be materialized here. Also, this bathhouse is a tad exposed."::
45194::$$$message_0409_0000_0005$$$::"Good grief, even the bath hasn't cured his stubbornness. I appreciate your patience, Sola-Ui."::
45195::$$$message_0409_0000_0006$$$::"Enough about me. You still haven't had enough to drink, have you? Hurry up and get drunk. Get drunk enough to pass out. So we can be alone together.[wvl canskip=false time=100][hffacechg2 chara=ソラウ face=照れ pos=winner time=300 textclear=0] (glance)"::
45196::$$$message_0409_0000_0007$$$::"Ngh...(shiver)"::
45197::$$$message_0409_0000_0008$$$::"Ha ha ha! I can't win against you."::
45198::$$$message_0409_0000_0009$$$::"Whew..."�)t